{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人吳卓羲與張曦雯（Kelly）今日（25日）出席無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》宣傳，受訪時卓羲自認是怕醜仔，問到兩人發展如何，他再次叫大家給予空間：「幾好。</p><p>（約咗出街未？</p><p>）唔話畀你聽，秘密，總之開心就得。</p><p>（林峯話你幾十歲係時候？</p><p>）佢都係幾十歲先結</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:32.032334+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T08:59:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_hash":"eded3848485028c6a886a257b90a7a74ce8d2764a7b82f155c77ffbd242996e8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}